$ boat secrets rotate ANTHROPIC_API_KEY sk-2
exit 0
--- stdout
set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
--- stderr
note: running VMs keep the old value
hint: restart VMs that need the new value (boat stop VM && boat start VM); VMs created with --secrets without it are unaffected
--- requests
GET /v1/secrets 
PUT /v1/secrets/ANTHROPIC_API_KEY {"value":"sk-2"}
